WEBVTT

00:00:03.710 --> 00:00:05.230
All right, who's next?

00:00:10.480 --> 00:00:12.740
Damn it! How's he so fast?

00:00:12.740 --> 00:00:14.370
I wonder!

00:00:16.350 --> 00:00:19.620
The <i>Partner</i> will begin 
rescuing passengers now.

00:00:24.510 --> 00:00:27.250
Prioritize the injured! 
Everyone is to evacuate!

00:00:27.250 --> 00:00:30.250
Well fought, everyone! Now hurry!

00:00:30.250 --> 00:00:33.290
This has been one crazy school trip.

00:00:33.790 --> 00:00:36.260
Once everyone's aboard the <i>Partner</i>, 
send it away from the battlefield.

00:00:45.020 --> 00:00:48.090
Master, a new enemy has appeared.

00:00:48.520 --> 00:00:49.620
It's a black Armor.

00:00:49.620 --> 00:00:51.690
I believe it's an elite enemy troop.

00:00:51.690 --> 00:00:53.030
Black Armor?

00:00:53.270 --> 00:00:54.400
Could it be...

00:00:56.860 --> 00:00:58.510
The Black Knight?

00:01:04.160 --> 00:01:06.450
<b>Trapped in</b>

00:01:06.450 --> 00:01:08.790
<b>a Dating Sim</b>

00:01:08.790 --> 00:01:13.420
<b>Trapped in
a Dating Sim</b>

00:02:29.500 --> 00:02:35.170
No Matter How Tough
the World of Otome Games Is

00:02:33.380 --> 00:02:35.630
Vandel! But why?

00:02:35.870 --> 00:02:38.880
The Black Knight showed up here?

00:02:39.210 --> 00:02:41.940
Who is this Black Knight?

00:02:41.940 --> 00:02:45.890
A knight of the principality who's been 
feared since before we were born.

00:02:46.470 --> 00:02:50.640
He single-handedly sank dozens 
of the kingdom's warships.

00:02:50.640 --> 00:02:56.530
Is it possible for Mr. Leon to 
defeat such a powerful knight?

00:02:56.530 --> 00:02:58.100
Activating drones.

00:03:06.330 --> 00:03:08.840
This guy must be using cheats.

00:03:08.840 --> 00:03:12.330
His Armor is far superior 
to any we've faced so far.

00:03:13.460 --> 00:03:14.460
This is gonna be tough.

00:03:18.760 --> 00:03:19.840
Can't dodge this!

00:03:19.840 --> 00:03:20.590
Pointless.

00:03:25.670 --> 00:03:27.070
You're so young.

00:03:27.070 --> 00:03:29.930
You can barely handle those 
weapons you're using.

00:03:29.930 --> 00:03:33.810
Luxion, stow the rifle and blade.

00:03:33.810 --> 00:03:35.940
What will you use next?

00:03:36.550 --> 00:03:37.940
My bare hands.

00:03:40.680 --> 00:03:41.990
You fool!

00:03:42.990 --> 00:03:44.240
Who's the fool?

00:03:44.240 --> 00:03:45.160
Impact.

00:03:47.210 --> 00:03:48.890
Master, behind you.

00:03:50.200 --> 00:03:51.290
Begone.

00:03:58.850 --> 00:04:01.220
Is that the Black Knight?

00:04:01.990 --> 00:04:06.470
Marie, I'm sorry. This is the end.

00:04:06.470 --> 00:04:07.470
Damn it!

00:04:10.820 --> 00:04:12.230
He can still fight?

00:04:12.740 --> 00:04:13.730
Jeez.

00:04:14.200 --> 00:04:17.360
Nobody told me he could 
pierce the Arroganz's armor.

00:04:17.360 --> 00:04:19.850
Armor performance down 30%.

00:04:19.850 --> 00:04:21.780
Strain on pilot increasing.

00:04:21.780 --> 00:04:23.430
I recommend we withdraw.

00:04:23.430 --> 00:04:24.610
No way.

00:04:24.900 --> 00:04:28.490
This is what you get for not 
taking the lives of your enemies.

00:04:28.790 --> 00:04:32.100
They've been forced into a position 
where they can't retreat.

00:04:32.100 --> 00:04:33.870
Rub it in, why don't you?

00:04:34.280 --> 00:04:37.630
Boy, you'll rue being born in the kingdom.

00:04:38.230 --> 00:04:42.380
Normally, I totally would've run by now, but...

00:04:42.380 --> 00:04:45.310
Leon, the rest is up to you.

00:04:45.310 --> 00:04:47.390
Promise you'll come back.

00:04:49.110 --> 00:04:51.390
Requesting permission to utilize main ship.

00:04:51.630 --> 00:04:54.310
Denied. We'd end up killing the Black Knight.

00:04:55.460 --> 00:04:57.230
I don't understand you.

00:05:04.530 --> 00:05:07.280
Don't underestimate the Arroganz's toughness!

00:05:07.280 --> 00:05:09.770
My Armor is leagues better than his!

00:05:09.770 --> 00:05:13.040
And his piloting skills are 
leagues better than yours.

00:05:20.840 --> 00:05:25.590
I mustn't lose to a knight of the kingdom.

00:05:25.590 --> 00:05:28.070
You must be pretty old, right?

00:05:28.070 --> 00:05:29.850
Why are you so determined to fight?

00:05:30.080 --> 00:05:32.710
Because it's my duty.

00:05:33.020 --> 00:05:34.110
Your duty?

00:05:36.480 --> 00:05:41.490
As a knight of the principality, 
I fight for the principality.

00:05:42.020 --> 00:05:44.610
I am simply fulfilling my duty.

00:05:46.610 --> 00:05:49.220
That's what it means to live.

00:05:50.310 --> 00:05:52.240
For the most part, I agree.

00:05:52.980 --> 00:05:54.500
But...

00:05:55.180 --> 00:05:58.140
For the present moment, even if it means 
acting beyond my responsibilities,

00:05:58.140 --> 00:05:59.500
I'm gonna do what I want to do!

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:02.700
You think you can stop me?

00:06:02.700 --> 00:06:03.750
Yeah, I'll beat you!

00:06:05.420 --> 00:06:07.170
<i>Damn! I fell for a classic move!</i>

00:06:14.830 --> 00:06:15.310
What?

00:06:16.570 --> 00:06:18.060
Have you thrown the battle?

00:06:18.480 --> 00:06:20.810
No, I win.

00:06:24.570 --> 00:06:27.170
What? How is it still moving?

00:06:31.450 --> 00:06:34.070
The Arroganz is part of Luxion.

00:06:34.070 --> 00:06:37.960
And I'm proud to say I purchased 
Luxion as a microtransaction.

00:06:40.340 --> 00:06:42.460
It's over. Surrender.

00:06:43.170 --> 00:06:45.840
No. Kill me.

00:06:46.100 --> 00:06:49.090
I'm trying to kill as few people as possible.

00:06:49.090 --> 00:06:51.230
Don't be ridiculous.

00:06:52.150 --> 00:06:57.100
Master, the <i>Partner</i> has brought the 
surrounding area under control.

00:06:57.610 --> 00:06:59.980
Nice work. I knew you could do it.

00:07:05.250 --> 00:07:08.490
Seriously? What a sore loser.

00:07:09.080 --> 00:07:12.110
I have no choice but to erase everything.

00:07:12.550 --> 00:07:15.210
It's the only way to make sure 
I don't go down in history

00:07:15.570 --> 00:07:18.580
as an incompetent and beardless 
man who lost to a child.

00:07:19.590 --> 00:07:21.120
What is that light?

00:07:21.590 --> 00:07:23.380
It's a special signal flare.

00:07:24.010 --> 00:07:28.760
It's far superior to even my own magic 
for simply gathering monsters.

00:07:28.760 --> 00:07:31.380
Come, monsters!

00:07:31.730 --> 00:07:34.390
Destroy it all!

00:07:38.500 --> 00:07:41.300
It's quite a magnificent sight to 
see so many of them in one place.

00:07:41.300 --> 00:07:46.770
Unfortunately, it seems you've no choice 
but to be destroyed along with us.

00:07:46.770 --> 00:07:49.030
Luxion, you've got this, right?

00:07:49.260 --> 00:07:51.530
Is it finally my turn to do something?

00:08:10.180 --> 00:08:12.420
I-I don't believe it.

00:08:12.420 --> 00:08:14.930
What's happening?

00:08:15.300 --> 00:08:18.930
You're not the only ones who 
had an ace up their sleeve.

00:08:20.950 --> 00:08:23.460
Once you've returned to 
your principality, make sure

00:08:23.890 --> 00:08:26.310
you tell them just how strong the kingdom is.

00:08:26.690 --> 00:08:29.330
You're not going to take my head as a trophy?

00:08:29.330 --> 00:08:32.430
Who needs an old man's head?
 Talk about creepy.

00:08:32.840 --> 00:08:34.950
Oh, but I will be taking your sword.

00:08:36.530 --> 00:08:40.000
Boy, someday your naïveté 
will be your undoing.

00:08:40.000 --> 00:08:40.950
Don't forget that.

00:08:41.260 --> 00:08:42.040
Huh?

00:08:46.690 --> 00:08:51.510
You sure do talk big for someone 
who was spared by my kindness.

00:08:51.510 --> 00:08:54.470
Looks like you don't get it, old man.

00:08:54.470 --> 00:08:56.040
What?!

00:08:56.040 --> 00:08:58.090
You're already finished.

00:08:59.100 --> 00:09:03.600
Don't you get it? You lost to a civilian ship.

00:09:03.600 --> 00:09:06.400
One carrying students, no less.

00:09:06.400 --> 00:09:08.860
But you were defeated by us.

00:09:08.860 --> 00:09:11.360
Do you know what that means?

00:09:11.360 --> 00:09:14.610
You continue to insult me, you vile—

00:09:14.610 --> 00:09:18.570
A bunch of grown-ass men fought their 
hardest against some children and lost.

00:09:18.570 --> 00:09:22.650
Do you really think there 
will be a next time for you?

00:09:23.420 --> 00:09:26.010
Look, old man, just retire already.

00:09:26.010 --> 00:09:28.510
In fact, retiring is your only choice.

00:09:28.510 --> 00:09:33.010
Your era has ended. 
Thank you for your service.

00:09:33.010 --> 00:09:38.010
You fiend! Are you telling 
us to live with our shame?!

00:09:38.900 --> 00:09:42.000
Don't losers have to do what 
winners tell them to do?

00:09:42.000 --> 00:09:44.440
Yeah, keep on living, even if it's in disgrace.

00:09:50.270 --> 00:09:55.030
Baron Bartfort, please have mercy.

00:09:55.300 --> 00:09:58.750
I don't know.

00:09:58.750 --> 00:10:00.800
I think I'll take any Armors that still work,

00:10:00.800 --> 00:10:05.160
and warships and airships 
that are still in good shape.

00:10:05.160 --> 00:10:07.560
The rest are floating hunks of stone.

00:10:07.560 --> 00:10:11.170
I'll break down any non-mobile airships 
and take every last bit of them, too.

00:10:12.530 --> 00:10:16.520
This is more like you, Master. 
How absolutely heartless.

00:10:16.520 --> 00:10:20.050
Right? I kind of like this side of me, too.

00:10:20.050 --> 00:10:26.090
W-Wait! Perhaps we should hold official 
negotiations between our nations...

00:10:26.780 --> 00:10:29.560
Why should I have to make 
any concessions when we won?

00:10:29.560 --> 00:10:30.810
But...

00:10:31.160 --> 00:10:32.560
Right?

00:10:32.560 --> 00:10:33.820
But...

00:10:34.320 --> 00:10:36.070
Right?

00:10:36.070 --> 00:10:38.290
Y-Yes, sir.

00:10:41.810 --> 00:10:47.330
Master, it would have been easy for my 
main ship to defeat the Black Knight.

00:10:47.710 --> 00:10:50.580
Why did you bother fighting him?

00:10:50.820 --> 00:10:53.990
Because you would've vaporized 
them in an instant.

00:10:53.990 --> 00:10:55.980
But what happens after that?

00:10:55.980 --> 00:10:59.090
The world would perceive you as a threat.

00:10:59.090 --> 00:11:03.380
Not just the principality, but the kingdom 
would probably act on it, too.

00:11:03.380 --> 00:11:06.330
Right? That sounds like a pain in the ass.

00:11:06.330 --> 00:11:08.500
I'm already doing more than I should.

00:11:08.910 --> 00:11:10.480
After all, I'm...

00:11:10.480 --> 00:11:13.110
A mob character, right?

00:11:13.410 --> 00:11:14.920
That's right.

00:11:16.930 --> 00:11:18.360
What's this about?

00:11:18.610 --> 00:11:21.030
This is my room. Let me in.

00:11:21.610 --> 00:11:23.860
I'm sleepy.

00:11:24.170 --> 00:11:27.030
Master, the two of them are in your room.

00:11:27.030 --> 00:11:27.800
Huh?

00:11:39.900 --> 00:11:42.460
<i>What a precious sight.</i>

00:11:43.660 --> 00:11:44.510
<i>But...</i>

00:11:47.690 --> 00:11:49.530
You should've told me they were sleeping!

00:11:49.530 --> 00:11:51.760
Angie's dad is gonna kill me!

00:11:51.760 --> 00:11:54.520
They fell asleep while waiting for you.

00:11:54.520 --> 00:11:56.650
They must have been tired.

00:11:56.970 --> 00:11:58.060
Bartfort.

00:11:58.760 --> 00:12:00.150
Chris.

00:12:00.150 --> 00:12:03.490
What do you want? You'd better 
not challenge me to another duel.

00:12:03.490 --> 00:12:04.910
I'm exhausted.

00:12:04.910 --> 00:12:09.640
You defeated the Black Knight. 
I'm surely beneath your notice.

00:12:10.200 --> 00:12:13.460
But someday, I will catch up to you.

00:12:13.880 --> 00:12:16.170
You are my goal.

00:12:19.320 --> 00:12:22.140
Right, then. Like we did with the sky pirates,

00:12:22.140 --> 00:12:25.430
I'm gonna force him to take 
credit for this incident.

00:12:26.200 --> 00:12:27.430
Study abroad?

00:12:27.430 --> 00:12:30.400
Are you sure you're not 
being too soft on them?

00:12:30.400 --> 00:12:33.440
Princess Hertrude invaded our nation.

00:12:33.700 --> 00:12:36.440
More importantly, how is Leon doing?

00:12:36.440 --> 00:12:38.930
H-How is he...

00:12:39.260 --> 00:12:41.290
He's been quite successful.

00:12:41.880 --> 00:12:45.000
We can't have him marrying the wrong person.

00:12:45.000 --> 00:12:46.780
He has no romantic prospects.

00:12:47.100 --> 00:12:49.450
The girls never liked him to begin with.

00:12:49.720 --> 00:12:51.790
That's what I don't understand.

00:12:51.790 --> 00:12:53.900
How does a knight who continues 
to be promoted single-handedly

00:12:53.900 --> 00:12:56.210
receive no attention from the girls?

00:12:58.600 --> 00:13:01.210
Ah, this is paradise.

00:13:06.930 --> 00:13:08.490
It's so tasty.

00:13:08.490 --> 00:13:12.220
If you like cookies, I'll have some 
brought in from my favorite shop.

00:13:12.220 --> 00:13:14.600
Tell me about the shop.

00:13:14.600 --> 00:13:17.740
No. I'm sure you'd buy their entire stock.

00:13:17.740 --> 00:13:22.030
Aw, come on. All I'd do is eat their most 
popular products in front of the girls.

00:13:22.030 --> 00:13:24.610
Or maybe hand them out to girls on diets.

00:13:24.610 --> 00:13:25.870
Don't.

00:13:25.870 --> 00:13:28.110
No. You mustn't. Bad!

00:13:29.210 --> 00:13:34.590
More importantly, Leon, you let Chris take 
credit for defeating the Black Knight.

00:13:34.590 --> 00:13:36.000
You did?

00:13:36.000 --> 00:13:42.000
Ladies, that was a highly 
sophisticated political decision.

00:13:43.670 --> 00:13:45.710
Regarding Chris's family, the Arclights?

00:13:46.310 --> 00:13:50.510
True, this incident will force them 
to accept him back into the family.

00:13:50.760 --> 00:13:53.520
Mr. Leon, you really are a kind man after all.

00:13:53.520 --> 00:13:55.790
Yeah, of course I am.

00:13:55.790 --> 00:13:58.170
Isn't that nice, Master?

00:13:58.170 --> 00:14:02.420
U-Um, there's something I've 
been wondering about.

00:14:02.420 --> 00:14:03.900
What is that thing?

00:14:03.900 --> 00:14:06.450
Oh, uh...

00:14:06.450 --> 00:14:08.910
This is Luxion, my familiar.

00:14:08.910 --> 00:14:11.900
I provide support for my master.

00:14:11.900 --> 00:14:14.870
I am not the product of 
magic, but rather science.

00:14:14.870 --> 00:14:16.700
I am an artificial intelligence with—

00:14:16.700 --> 00:14:18.790
Please don't touch my lens.

00:14:19.110 --> 00:14:20.920
It's rather charming.

00:14:21.160 --> 00:14:23.250
You're so cute, Lux.

00:14:23.250 --> 00:14:24.800
Lux?

00:14:24.800 --> 00:14:29.710
Aw, what a nice nickname, Lux.

00:14:29.710 --> 00:14:35.290
If you have time to tease me, perhaps 
you should worry about yourself instead.

00:14:35.290 --> 00:14:37.560
What do you mean?

00:14:37.890 --> 00:14:41.260
Those five appear to be plotting something.

00:14:45.490 --> 00:14:46.820
Huh?

00:14:47.270 --> 00:14:48.900
What is this?

00:14:48.900 --> 00:14:51.380
We will challenge Bartfort with this.

00:14:51.800 --> 00:14:54.200
We'll defeat him and move forward.

00:14:54.200 --> 00:14:57.210
How did you make this?

00:14:57.580 --> 00:15:01.370
We gathered together the parts and 
spent sleepless nights working on it.

00:15:01.370 --> 00:15:03.590
The materials cost a mere 500,000 dia.

00:15:05.340 --> 00:15:08.190
<i>They blew 500,000 dia on this piece of junk?</i>

00:15:08.190 --> 00:15:10.450
<i>They must be crazy.</i>

00:15:11.090 --> 00:15:13.000
I can't believing they're having a rematch.

00:15:11.330 --> 00:15:13.000
Handmade Armor, huh?

00:15:13.000 --> 00:15:15.100
This time the prince and his crew will win.

00:15:13.410 --> 00:15:15.100
They pulled all-nighters building it together.

00:15:15.330 --> 00:15:17.900
I've had just about enough of the prince.

00:15:17.900 --> 00:15:19.650
I feel sorry for Leon.

00:15:19.650 --> 00:15:22.750
I hope Mr. Leon doesn't get hurt.

00:15:22.750 --> 00:15:24.730
The award ceremony is tomorrow.

00:15:25.270 --> 00:15:29.740
Don't meddle in their relationship 
with Marie if they win, huh?

00:15:30.070 --> 00:15:33.000
What do they think our previous duel was for?

00:15:33.000 --> 00:15:35.550
Why didn't you refuse to duel them?

00:15:35.550 --> 00:15:38.210
I figured I'd lose to them.

00:15:38.210 --> 00:15:40.250
Lose? But why?

00:15:40.250 --> 00:15:44.620
If they're so desperate to be 
with Marie, then I'll let them.

00:15:44.620 --> 00:15:49.010
When I thought about it, I realized 
Livia was too good for them.

00:15:49.010 --> 00:15:51.260
Took you long enough.

00:15:51.590 --> 00:15:54.250
There's no such thing as too late.

00:15:55.000 --> 00:15:57.010
You're sure you're okay with me piloting it?

00:15:57.400 --> 00:15:59.580
I hate to admit it, but I can't beat him.

00:15:59.580 --> 00:16:01.720
I'm only good with swords. I can't do it.

00:16:01.720 --> 00:16:03.770
We're trusting you with all our hopes.

00:16:04.290 --> 00:16:06.850
You've got the best chance of doing it.

00:16:06.850 --> 00:16:08.650
Get out there and beat Bartfort.

00:16:08.870 --> 00:16:10.020
Sure thing!

00:16:11.650 --> 00:16:14.170
Their friendship is so refreshing.

00:16:14.170 --> 00:16:16.160
They sure do like to rub it in, don't they?

00:16:16.730 --> 00:16:19.660
Now, let's go lose.

00:16:21.910 --> 00:16:22.910
Begin!

00:16:26.670 --> 00:16:28.210
What's wrong, Bartfort?

00:16:28.210 --> 00:16:29.800
Hit me with everything you've got!

00:16:30.100 --> 00:16:33.530
Wow, you're all fired up. 
Are you a hot-blooded guy?

00:16:34.420 --> 00:16:37.820
Master, please tell Greg to 
exit his Armor immediately.

00:16:37.820 --> 00:16:40.200
That junkpile is about to explode.

00:16:40.200 --> 00:16:41.470
What? No way.

00:16:41.470 --> 00:16:43.440
The interior was assembled haphazardly.

00:16:43.440 --> 00:16:45.340
Internal temperatures are abnormally high.

00:16:45.340 --> 00:16:48.980
I can only say I'm impressed it's 
moving at all given the circumstances.

00:16:48.980 --> 00:16:51.480
So it's out of control, huh?

00:16:51.480 --> 00:16:54.360
Hey, there's something wrong with your Armor!

00:16:54.360 --> 00:16:54.860
Get out of it!

00:16:55.900 --> 00:16:57.620
You're trying to trick me, aren't you?

00:16:57.960 --> 00:16:59.370
No, listen to me!

00:16:59.370 --> 00:17:00.490
Go!

00:17:00.490 --> 00:17:01.370
You can do it!

00:17:01.030 --> 00:17:02.870
Get him!

00:17:01.370 --> 00:17:03.710
Damn it. Ref, stop the fight!

00:17:03.710 --> 00:17:05.250
There's something wrong with his Armor!

00:17:05.470 --> 00:17:08.110
Bartfort, you disgrace yourself.

00:17:08.110 --> 00:17:11.000
Why can't you face their feelings head-on?

00:17:11.000 --> 00:17:14.450
Don't be absurd! Why don't you start 
by facing my words head-on, huh?

00:17:14.450 --> 00:17:16.200
You reap what you sow.

00:17:16.200 --> 00:17:19.150
You make things difficult for yourself 
by behaving terribly all the time.

00:17:19.150 --> 00:17:21.260
Whatever. Help me figure 
out how to deal with this.

00:17:21.600 --> 00:17:23.390
Analysis complete.

00:17:23.390 --> 00:17:25.640
We can destroy the Armor 
without causing an explosion.

00:17:25.880 --> 00:17:27.650
Destroy it? You're kidding, right?

00:17:28.000 --> 00:17:30.400
Even I'd feel bad about that!

00:17:29.070 --> 00:17:30.400
Keep your head in the fight!

00:17:30.400 --> 00:17:33.140
Then the Armor will explode, killing Greg.

00:17:33.140 --> 00:17:33.900
Hey!

00:17:33.900 --> 00:17:35.330
Go on, Greg!

00:17:35.330 --> 00:17:36.440
That's it!

00:17:36.440 --> 00:17:37.640
He's driving him back!

00:17:37.640 --> 00:17:39.530
Show him how strong you are!

00:17:39.530 --> 00:17:41.450
This is the end!

00:17:41.450 --> 00:17:43.540
Master, we're out of time.

00:17:43.540 --> 00:17:48.890
You guys suck for making me do this!

00:17:48.890 --> 00:17:49.790
Impact.

00:17:55.700 --> 00:17:57.550
I'm so done.

00:17:59.550 --> 00:18:00.440
Greg!

00:17:59.550 --> 00:18:02.190
Bartfort wins.

00:18:00.440 --> 00:18:01.860
Again?

00:18:01.860 --> 00:18:03.390
I suppose I'm not surprised.

00:18:03.390 --> 00:18:05.060
Next time we'll beat him.

00:18:05.060 --> 00:18:09.560
No! My 500,000 dia!

00:18:11.670 --> 00:18:17.700
I didn't want to break it, but everyone 
keeps treating me like trash.

00:18:17.970 --> 00:18:20.080
Come on, pull yourself together.

00:18:20.080 --> 00:18:22.450
You'll ruin the ceremony.

00:18:22.450 --> 00:18:24.460
Why are we in full dress, anyway?

00:18:24.810 --> 00:18:26.300
This award ceremony is just for

00:18:26.300 --> 00:18:30.460
handing out participation awards to the 
students who fought the principality, right?

00:18:30.460 --> 00:18:33.000
What? Nobody told you?

00:18:33.000 --> 00:18:35.480
You're being awarded a real 
distinguished service medal

00:18:35.480 --> 00:18:38.590
for capturing the principality's princess.

00:18:38.590 --> 00:18:39.370
Huh?

00:18:39.830 --> 00:18:41.590
Leon, what are you doing?

00:18:41.810 --> 00:18:43.750
The ceremony is starting.

00:18:44.100 --> 00:18:46.100
No! I don't wanna go!

00:18:46.100 --> 00:18:49.850
Hurry it up. My father and 
brother are in attendance.

00:18:50.150 --> 00:18:52.890
I want to properly introduce you to them.

00:18:52.890 --> 00:18:54.360
Introduce me? Why?

00:18:54.360 --> 00:18:56.390
B-Because...

00:18:56.390 --> 00:18:58.360
Never mind. Just hurry up.

00:19:04.710 --> 00:19:06.600
<i>This is a dream.</i>

00:19:07.340 --> 00:19:09.250
<i>When I wake up, I'll be 
at the entrance ceremony</i>

00:19:09.250 --> 00:19:10.910
<i>marking the start of my life at the academy.</i>

00:19:10.910 --> 00:19:13.180
<i>While whining about how 
hard it is to find a wife,</i>

00:19:13.180 --> 00:19:18.690
<i>I'll study the way of tea under 
my master and buy a new tea set.</i>

00:19:18.690 --> 00:19:23.120
Leon Fou Bartfort, for 
your meritorious deeds,

00:19:23.120 --> 00:19:25.140
you are granted the title of viscount.

00:19:25.480 --> 00:19:29.790
This distinguished service award comes with 
recommendations from the royal family,

00:19:29.790 --> 00:19:34.870
the Redgrave family, the Field family, 
the Seberg family, the Arclight family,

00:19:34.870 --> 00:19:39.150
the Atlee family, and the Roseblade family.

00:19:39.460 --> 00:19:42.440
Do not forget to be 
grateful on this occasion.

00:19:42.870 --> 00:19:45.100
<i>I can't do that! Not even for you, Master!</i>

00:19:50.230 --> 00:19:53.790
<i>What does he think he's doing? 
He's just a mob character.</i>

00:19:54.300 --> 00:19:55.420
<i>You just watch.</i>

00:19:55.420 --> 00:20:01.170
<i>I'll acquire the Saint's remaining items 
and completely become the protagonist!</i>

00:20:02.380 --> 00:20:04.930
I can't be a viscount.

00:20:05.580 --> 00:20:09.560
I was supposed to live a carefree 
life as a back country baronet.

00:20:16.230 --> 00:20:18.690
Mr. Leon, you were wonderful.

00:20:19.340 --> 00:20:20.510
Livia...

00:20:20.820 --> 00:20:22.530
U-Um...

00:20:22.530 --> 00:20:24.070
Y-Yes?

00:20:24.360 --> 00:20:27.580
You've been avoiding me, haven't you?

00:20:27.580 --> 00:20:32.580
I just... didn't know what to say to you.

00:20:36.200 --> 00:20:39.290
I know this may be an inconvenience for you,

00:20:40.490 --> 00:20:43.630
but I meant what I said then.

00:20:44.790 --> 00:20:49.220
It's no inconvenience at all. I just...

00:20:49.220 --> 00:20:52.980
Someday, I hope you'll tell me your answer.

00:20:53.870 --> 00:20:54.920
Livia...

00:20:58.350 --> 00:21:01.060
Come on. Angie's waiting for us.

00:21:03.410 --> 00:21:07.240
<i>Maybe it's time for me to steel my resolve.</i>

00:21:12.280 --> 00:21:14.750
<i>I may be a mob character, 
but I still want to be with them.</i>

00:21:15.220 --> 00:21:19.330
<i>No matter how tough the 
world of otome games is...</i>

00:21:22.920 --> 00:21:25.770
Master, you and Marie are quite similar.

00:21:25.770 --> 00:21:26.510
Huh?

00:21:26.510 --> 00:21:30.250
Both of you used knowledge 
from your previous lives

00:21:30.250 --> 00:21:32.760
to get close to the protagonist 
and romantic interests.

00:21:32.760 --> 00:21:35.520
From my perspective, you're the same.

00:21:36.290 --> 00:21:38.960
You think I'm the same as Marie?

00:21:38.960 --> 00:21:41.900
As far as I'm concerned, 
it's a trivial matter.

00:21:41.900 --> 00:21:45.980
Go ahead and be as friendly with 
Olivia and Angelica as you'd like.

00:21:45.980 --> 00:21:48.780
How do you expect me to do 
that after what you've said?

00:21:48.780 --> 00:21:54.060
Your indecisiveness brought 
about this undesired result.

00:21:54.060 --> 00:21:56.160
Though you could also say it's 
what I'd expect from you.

00:21:56.520 --> 00:21:58.290
Mr. Leon, hurry.

00:21:58.290 --> 00:22:00.040
How long are you going to make us wait?

00:22:01.480 --> 00:22:04.920
I wish I had a more 
pure-hearted, honest partner.

00:22:04.920 --> 00:22:07.800
I could say the same thing, Master.

00:22:10.050 --> 00:22:12.720
<b>Trapped in a Dating Sim</b>
